A photorealistic close-up portrait of twin toddler boys with mischievous, joyful expressions, their faces nearly touching as they share a moment of pure delight. Soft natural window light illuminates their rosy cheeks and sparkling eyes. One twin has a slightly raised eyebrow while the other shows a gap-toothed grin. Shallow depth of field with a warm, creamy bokeh background suggesting a cozy home environment. The image captures authentic sibling connection and the playful energy of early childhood. Shot in the style of lifestyle family photography with rich, warm tones and intimate framing.
